 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 2.71,
   "end": 8.9,
   "text": "You carefully place the skull next to the king's torso - but what is that?"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.528,
   "end": 11.54,
   "text": "The skull rolls to the skeleton's neck and"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.607,
   "end": 14.82,
   "text": "grows back there as if it had never been anywhere else!"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.913,
   "end": 20.9,
   "text": "At the same moment, however, when the king's skull returns to its rightful place,"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.98,
   "end": 24.74,
   "text": "you feel an ice-cold wind on your neck..."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.78,
   "end": 29.54,
   "text": "Fearing the worst again, you close your eyes in fear: nothing happens..."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.56,
   "end": 32.9,
   "text": "But when you dare to open them again - the coffin is empty!"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.02,
   "end": 36.9,
   "text": "You close your eyes for the second time and open them again:"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.94,
   "end": 43.06,
   "text": "But nothing has changed: the king's sarcophagus is and remains empty!"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.711,
   "end": 46.98,
   "text": "Before you can attempt to run away on your shaking legs, however,"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.06,
   "end": 53.862,
   "text": "you hear a soft voice behind you, obviously quite amused: \"Welcome, my friend...\""
  },
  {
   "start": 53.889,
   "end": 54.742,
   "text": "It's King Richard!"
  }
 ]
}
